<ix:nonNumeric contextRef="From2023-01-01to2023-09-30" escape="true" name="INVO:ScheduleOfEsimatedUsefulLivesOfPropertyAndEquimentTableTextBlock"><p id="xdx_894_ecustom--ScheduleOfEsimatedUsefulLivesOfPropertyAndEquimentTableTextBlock_zPkngKjQWj46" style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">The
estimated useful lives and accumulated depreciation for equipment are as follows as of September 30, 2023, and December 31, 2022:</span></p>

